{"candidate_output": "```python\ndef is_Diff(num):\n    num_str = str(num)\n    odd_sum = sum(int(num_str[i]) for i in range(len(num_str)) if i % 2 == 0)\n    even_sum = sum(int(num_str[i]) for i in range(len(num_str)) if i % 2 != 0)\n    return abs(odd_sum - even_sum) % 11 == 0\n\n# Test cases\nassert is_Diff(12345) == False\nassert is_Diff(1212112) == True\nassert is_Diff(1212) == False\n```", "case_id": "code_mbpp-d3ab3d1939c51f3c", "context": "assert is_Diff (12345) == False\nassert is_Diff(1212112) == True\nassert is_Diff(1212) == False", "difficulty": "medium", "generator_id": "gpt-4o-mini", "group_id": "mbpp-a88a7902cb4e", "meta": {"oracle_detail": "tests passed", "oracle_method": "code:exec"}, "origin": "real", "reference": "def is_Diff(n): \n    return (n % 11 == 0) ", "reference_provenance": "MBPP reference solution", "rubric_id": "", "rubric_version": "", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "source": "MBPP", "source_license": "CC-BY-4.0", "task_class": "code", "task_input": "Write a python function to find whether a number is divisible by 11."}
