{"candidate_output": "```python\ndef list_to_float(lst):\n    return [(float(x), float(y)) for x, y in lst]\n```", "case_id": "code_mbpp-2c691a8b284b0e03", "context": "assert list_to_float( [(\"3\", \"4\"), (\"1\", \"26.45\"), (\"7.32\", \"8\"), (\"4\", \"8\")] ) == [(3.0, 4.0), (1.0, 26.45), (7.32, 8.0), (4.0, 8.0)]\nassert list_to_float( [(\"4\", \"4\"), (\"2\", \"27\"), (\"4.12\", \"9\"), (\"7\", \"11\")] ) == [(4.0, 4.0), (2.0, 27.0), (4.12, 9.0), (7.0, 11.0)]\nassert list_to_float( [(\"6\", \"78\"), (\"5\", \"26.45\"), (\"1.33\", \"4\"), (\"82\", \"13\")] ) == [(6.0, 78.0), (5.0, 26.45), (1.33, 4.0), (82.0, 13.0)]", "difficulty": "medium", "generator_id": "gpt-4o-mini", "group_id": "mbpp-2ac878b0e218", "meta": {"oracle_detail": "tests passed", "oracle_method": "code:exec"}, "origin": "real", "reference": "def list_to_float(test_list):\n  res = []\n  for tup in test_list:\n    temp = []\n    for ele in tup:\n      if ele.isalpha():\n        temp.append(ele)\n      else:\n        temp.append(float(ele))\n    res.append((temp[0],temp[1])) \n  return res", "reference_provenance": "MBPP reference solution", "rubric_id": "", "rubric_version": "", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "source": "MBPP", "source_license": "CC-BY-4.0", "task_class": "code", "task_input": "Write a function to convert all possible convertible elements in a list of lists to floats."}
{"candidate_output": "```python\ndef remove_odd(s):\n    return ''.join(s[i] for i in range(len(s)) if i % 2 != 0)\n```", "case_id": "code_mbpp-c7b80a64b5dbf725", "context": "assert remove_odd(\"python\")==(\"yhn\")\nassert remove_odd(\"program\")==(\"rga\")\nassert remove_odd(\"language\")==(\"agae\")", "difficulty": "medium", "generator_id": "gpt-4.1-nano", "group_id": "mbpp-0ef962215cc0", "meta": {"oracle_detail": "tests passed", "oracle_method": "code:exec"}, "origin": "real", "reference": "def remove_odd(str1):\n str2 = ''\n for i in range(1, len(str1) + 1):\n    if(i % 2 == 0):\n        str2 = str2 + str1[i - 1]\n return str2", "reference_provenance": "MBPP reference solution", "rubric_id": "", "rubric_version": "", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "source": "MBPP", "source_license": "CC-BY-4.0", "task_class": "code", "task_input": "Write a function to remove odd characters in a string."}
