{"candidate_output": "```python\ndef next_smallest_palindrome(n):\n    def is_palindrome(num):\n        return str(num) == str(num)[::-1]\n    \n    candidate = n - 1\n    while candidate >= 0:\n        if is_palindrome(candidate):\n            return candidate\n        candidate -= 1\n    # If no smaller palindrome found (e.g., n=0), return 0\n    return 0\n```", "case_id": "code_mbpp-b3a49f7099c8937a", "context": "assert next_smallest_palindrome(99)==101\nassert next_smallest_palindrome(1221)==1331\nassert next_smallest_palindrome(120)==121", "difficulty": "medium", "generator_id": "gpt-4.1-nano", "group_id": "mbpp-ad5736686512", "meta": {"oracle_detail": "exit 1", "oracle_method": "code:exec"}, "origin": "real", "reference": "import sys\ndef next_smallest_palindrome(num):\n    numstr = str(num)\n    for i in range(num+1,sys.maxsize):\n        if str(i) == str(i)[::-1]:\n            return i", "reference_provenance": "MBPP reference solution", "rubric_id": "", "rubric_version": "", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "source": "MBPP", "source_license": "CC-BY-4.0", "task_class": "code", "task_input": "Write a function to find the next smallest palindrome of a specified integer, returned as an integer."}
