{"candidate_output": "```python\ndef start_withp(words):\n    for word in words:\n        # Split the string into individual words\n        split_words = word.split()\n        for w in split_words:\n            if w.startswith('P'):\n                # Return the first two words starting with 'P'\n                p_words = [w]\n                # Continue searching for the next word starting with 'P'\n                for next_w in split_words[split_words.index(w)+1:]:\n                    if next_w.startswith('P'):\n                        p_words.append(next_w)\n                        break\n                # If only one found, look in the remaining list\n                if len(p_words) < 2:\n                    for next_w in split_words[split_words.index(w)+1:]:\n                        if next_w.startswith('P'):\n                            p_words.append(next_w)\n                            break\n                # If still less than 2, continue searching in other strings\n                if len(p_words) < 2:\n                    continue\n                return tuple(p_words[:2])\n    return None\n```", "case_id": "code_mbpp-c5a01c19fb737da9", "context": "assert start_withp([\"Python PHP\", \"Java JavaScript\", \"c c++\"])==('Python', 'PHP')\nassert start_withp([\"Python Programming\",\"Java Programming\"])==('Python','Programming')\nassert start_withp([\"Pqrst Pqr\",\"qrstuv\"])==('Pqrst','Pqr')", "difficulty": "medium", "generator_id": "gpt-4.1-nano", "group_id": "mbpp-090d3859ff68", "meta": {"oracle_detail": "tests passed", "oracle_method": "code:exec"}, "origin": "real", "reference": "import re\ndef start_withp(words):\n for w in words:\n        m = re.match(\"(P\\w+)\\W(P\\w+)\", w)\n        if m:\n            return m.groups()", "reference_provenance": "MBPP reference solution", "rubric_id": "", "rubric_version": "", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "source": "MBPP", "source_license": "CC-BY-4.0", "task_class": "code", "task_input": "Write a function to return two words from a list of words starting with letter 'p'."}
