{"candidate_output": "```python\ndef set_left_most_unset_bit(n):\n    # Find the position of the leftmost unset bit\n    position = 0\n    temp = n\n    while temp > 0:\n        position += 1\n        temp >>= 1\n    \n    # Create a mask to set the leftmost unset bit\n    mask = 1 << (position - 1)\n    \n    # If the leftmost bit is already set, return n\n    if n & mask:\n        return n\n    \n    # Set the leftmost unset bit\n    return n | mask\n\n# Test cases\nassert set_left_most_unset_bit(10) == 14\nassert set_left_most_unset_bit(12) == 14\nassert set_left_most_unset_bit(15) == 15\n```", "case_id": "code_mbpp-40c3df7560b9337d", "context": "assert set_left_most_unset_bit(10) == 14\nassert set_left_most_unset_bit(12) == 14\nassert set_left_most_unset_bit(15) == 15", "difficulty": "medium", "generator_id": "gpt-4o-mini", "group_id": "mbpp-20e9c64c05a5", "meta": {"oracle_detail": "exit 1", "oracle_method": "code:exec"}, "origin": "real", "reference": "def set_left_most_unset_bit(n): \n    if not (n & (n + 1)): \n        return n \n    pos, temp, count = 0, n, 0 \n    while temp: \n        if not (temp & 1): \n            pos = count      \n        count += 1; temp>>=1\n    return (n | (1 << (pos))) ", "reference_provenance": "MBPP reference solution", "rubric_id": "", "rubric_version": "", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "source": "MBPP", "source_license": "CC-BY-4.0", "task_class": "code", "task_input": "Write a python function to set the left most unset bit."}
