{"candidate_output": "```python\ndef sum_of_divisors(n):\n    total = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            total += i\n    return total\n\ndef are_equivalent(a, b):\n    return sum_of_divisors(a) == sum_of_divisors(b)\n\n# Test cases\nassert are_equivalent(36, 57) == False\nassert are_equivalent(2, 4) == False\nassert are_equivalent(23, 47) == True\n```", "case_id": "code_mbpp-420f1fd5b42a4eb8", "context": "assert are_equivalent(36, 57) == False\nassert are_equivalent(2, 4) == False\nassert are_equivalent(23, 47) == True", "difficulty": "medium", "generator_id": "gpt-4o-mini", "group_id": "mbpp-3f9807cb9ae9", "meta": {"oracle_detail": "exit 1", "oracle_method": "code:exec"}, "origin": "real", "reference": "import math \ndef div_sum(n): \n  total = 1\n  i = 2\n\n  while i * i <= n:\n    if (n % i == 0):\n      total = (total + i + math.floor(n / i))\n    i += 1\n\n  return total\n\ndef are_equivalent(num1, num2): \n    return div_sum(num1) == div_sum(num2); ", "reference_provenance": "MBPP reference solution", "rubric_id": "", "rubric_version": "", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "source": "MBPP", "source_license": "CC-BY-4.0", "task_class": "code", "task_input": "Write a function to determine if the sum of the divisors of two integers are the same."}
{"candidate_output": "```python\ndef eulerian_num(n, m):\n    # Initialize a 2D list with zeros\n    # a[n][m] will hold the Eulerian number for given n and m\n    a = [[0] * (n + 1) for _ in range(n + 1)]\n    a[1][0] = 1  # Base case\n\n    for i in range(2, n + 1):\n        for j in range(i):\n            a[i][j] = (i - j) * a[i - 1][j - 1] + (j + 1) * a[i - 1][j]\n    return a[n][m]\n\n# Test assertions\nassert eulerian_num(3, 1) == 4\nassert eulerian_num(4, 1) == 11\nassert eulerian_num(5, 3) == 26\n```", "case_id": "code_mbpp-b8dfc2e89282def9", "context": "assert eulerian_num(3, 1) == 4\nassert eulerian_num(4, 1) == 11\nassert eulerian_num(5, 3) == 26", "difficulty": "medium", "generator_id": "gpt-4.1-nano", "group_id": "mbpp-454f63ac30c8", "meta": {"oracle_detail": "tests passed", "oracle_method": "code:exec"}, "origin": "real", "reference": "def eulerian_num(n, m): \n\tif (m >= n or n == 0): \n\t\treturn 0 \n\tif (m == 0): \n\t\treturn 1 \n\treturn ((n - m) * eulerian_num(n - 1, m - 1) +(m + 1) * eulerian_num(n - 1, m))", "reference_provenance": "MBPP reference solution", "rubric_id": "", "rubric_version": "", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "source": "MBPP", "source_license": "CC-BY-4.0", "task_class": "code", "task_input": "Write a function to find the Eulerian number a(n, m)."}
{"candidate_output": "```python\ndef find_Average_Of_Cube(n):\n    if n <= 0:\n        return 0\n    sum_of_cubes = sum(i**3 for i in range(1, n + 1))\n    average = sum_of_cubes / n\n    return average\n\n# Test cases\nassert find_Average_Of_Cube(2) == 4.5\nassert find_Average_Of_Cube(3) == 12\nassert find_Average_Of_Cube(1) == 1\n```", "case_id": "code_mbpp-685cefdae86c95b3", "context": "assert find_Average_Of_Cube(2) == 4.5\nassert find_Average_Of_Cube(3) == 12\nassert find_Average_Of_Cube(1) == 1", "difficulty": "medium", "generator_id": "gpt-4o-mini", "group_id": "mbpp-5658b88806a2", "meta": {"oracle_detail": "tests passed", "oracle_method": "code:exec"}, "origin": "real", "reference": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n):  \n    sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1): \n        sum += i * i * i  \n    return round(sum / n, 6) ", "reference_provenance": "MBPP reference solution", "rubric_id": "", "rubric_version": "", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "source": "MBPP", "source_license": "CC-BY-4.0", "task_class": "code", "task_input": "Write a python function to find the average of cubes of first n natural numbers."}
{"candidate_output": "```python\nimport math\n\ndef harmonic_sum(n):\n    return sum(1.0 / i for i in range(1, n))\n```", "case_id": "code_mbpp-2bce6c6d895ffd33", "context": "assert math.isclose(harmonic_sum(7), 2.5928571428571425, rel_tol=0.001)\nassert math.isclose(harmonic_sum(4), 2.083333333333333, rel_tol=0.001)\nassert math.isclose(harmonic_sum(19), 3.547739657143682, rel_tol=0.001)", "difficulty": "medium", "generator_id": "gpt-4.1-nano", "group_id": "mbpp-766cb53c753b", "meta": {"oracle_detail": "exit 1", "oracle_method": "code:exec"}, "origin": "real", "reference": "def harmonic_sum(n):\n  if n < 2:\n    return 1\n  else:\n    return 1 / n + (harmonic_sum(n - 1)) ", "reference_provenance": "MBPP reference solution", "rubric_id": "", "rubric_version": "", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "source": "MBPP", "source_license": "CC-BY-4.0", "task_class": "code", "task_input": "Write a function that takes in an integer n and calculates the harmonic sum of n-1."}
